  "title": "Paramount-WBD Merger Faces EU and US Legal Challenges",
  "summary": "Paramount's £80bn takeover of Warner Bros. Discovery is moving closer to completion after EU approval, but ongoing legal challenges by U.S. states and the European Commission have delayed the deal. The merger faces opposition from states and regulators over financial stability concerns.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The European Commission has approved Paramount’s £80bn takeover of Warner Bros. Discovery",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
